{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-486f7416a2baf549c15315018848b26d077cd8f955e52737","family_id":"KR:012159","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법","kind":"법률","source_version":"284117","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=284117","source_sha256":"c141291f23520264444e31f7c7002ae169ff7b5f49b50f81aade863d8c364da6","body_sha256":"df04cf1bf708f69c1b09ee2b9ce7aff1734809e4adac33f2ab26cf8999c8fefb","article_count":0,"full_text":"20141119\n12843\nADDENDA\nArticle 1 (Enforcement Date)\nThis Act shall enter into force on January 1, 2015. \nArticle 2 (Preparation for Enforcement of this Act) \nThe appointment of Commissioners or employees of the Inquest, the establishment and promulgation of the rules of the Inquest, related to the enforcement of this Act, the preparation for establishing the Inquest, and the preparation necessary for a meeting of representatives of families of victims, may be performed before this Act enters into force.  \nArticle 3 (Applicability to Beginning of Term of Office of Commissioners)  \nThe term of office of Commissioners of the Inquest first appointed under this Act shall be deemed to begin on the date this Act enters into force.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.title.json","sha256":"4c74ab84248a6134281cf6996ae8261b572ae5b9e5754e6ad1e8c39880d0d84f"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\la